---
title: "Protocol-2 game: deal to results (3 phones, one Doppelganger)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: start
    lg1: night
    lg2: Breaks FollowUpFromFollowUpRequest
    lg3: Breaks FollowUpNotRefused in some cases
    lg4: Path to the FollowUpFromFollowUpRequest or FollowUpNotRefused bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 purple
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 mayBreak
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Looking at cards
  s1: Doppelganger window: nothing copied yet
  s2: Doppelganger window: she copied the Robber
  s3: Doppelganger window: her repeated look is stored as her rob
  s4: Night window
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the host moves on
  s1 --> s2: she looks at a player
  s2 --> s3: her phone resends the look (answer lost)
  s3 --> s3: she sends her rob
  s3 --> s4: the host moves on
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 tan
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 purple
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 purple
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 purple
  class s3 mayBreak
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 purple
  class s4 breaks
  class s4 bugPath
